{"sections":[{"slug":"线性偏微分方程","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"线性偏微分方程"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">线性偏微分方程</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"线性偏微分方程"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">朴素定义</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">线性偏微分方程</span></strong> (linear PDE) <span lang=\"zh\">是如下形式的方程</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">组</span>):\n$$\r\n\\sum_{j=1}^p R_{ij} u_j =0,\\quad 1\\leq i \\leq q,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $R_{ij}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/微分算子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线性微分算子</span>"}},{"Plain":", $u_j$ <span lang=\"zh\">为变量</span> $x_1,\\cdots,x_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的函数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">名称中</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">线性</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的意思是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">方程的若干个解的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">常系数</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">线性组合仍是一个解</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">抽象定义</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">是某种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/线性微分算子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线性微分算子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">构成的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">线性偏微分方程组</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为左</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/D-模","text":"$D$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">同态</span>\n$$\r\nR\\colon D^p \\to D^q.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这相当于</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个矩阵</span> $(R_{ij})$. <span lang=\"zh\">注意在同态</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, $R_{ij}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">右乘</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $D^p$ <span lang=\"zh\">的分量上</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于左</span> $D$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $N$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义上述的</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">解</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为左</span> $D$-<span lang=\"zh\">模同态</span> $u\\colon D^q\\to N$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\nu\\circ R = 0.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这相当于选取</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $q$ <span lang=\"zh\">个元素</span> $u_i\\,(1\\leq i\\leq q)$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\n\\sum_{j=1}^p R_{ij} u_j =0,\\quad 1\\leq i \\leq q,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即得到朴素的定义</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">线性偏微分方程组</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">解空间</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">就是</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{D}(\\operatorname{coker}R,N).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这个解空间仅依赖于</span> $\\operatorname{coker}R$ <span lang=\"zh\">这个左</span> $D$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而同态</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">是这个左</span> $D$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的表现</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">于是我们发现</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">线性偏微分方程组</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">就是左</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/D-模","text":"$D$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}